Certainly agree that when Barack Obama took office as president in '09, America saw its deficits soar - it became a significant issue overshadowing many initiatives. However, placing sole blame solely rests upon him feels simplistic. Our country had grappled with such issues long before his arrival and various factors exacerbated budgetary woes further complicating his presidency.

